    "updated_at": "2025-03-17T11:38:50Z",
    "body": "So the spec is a bit hand-wavy here and allows both behaviors of course (https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#update-the-rendering steps 5 allows this). I guess the question would be:\n\n * Is this behavior intentional on WebKit's / Blink's end? cc @rniwa @mfreed7 \n * Would you be willing to change it? In particular, it seems somewhat consistent that hidden docs would be removed like step 3 does.\n\nThat said, Gecko is also not 100% consistent on this. In particular, I suspect things like IntersectionObserver callbacks may fire or so. I plan to refactor some of our rendering code to match the spec more closely in the following month or so, and that would be fixed as part of it tho.",
